nothing: mirror: the listing zig-out/mirror/neg/none.manifest is not a manifest
nothing: exit 1
=== negative 8: a fleet whose data must stay in the shop, and a keeper in the warehouse ===
law: fleet (line 31): annex keeps data on a disk of its own in warehouse, and RESIDENCY records (line 42) says the data stays in shop: a member that keeps a disk stands where the data stays
law: exit 1
